# Cursor Rules for Drevvy

## Markdown Documentation

When creating new markdown files, run the documentation updater to keep the summary current:

```bash
pnpm update-docs
```

Or use watch mode to automatically update:

```bash
pnpm watch-docs
```

This will automatically analyze and add new markdown files to `MARKDOWN_FILES_SUMMARY.md`.

See `scripts/README_MARKDOWN_UPDATER.md` for details.

